### Existence audit (2026-10-29, five independent searches)

- **Anthropic lineage pages show no 5.4:** the Sonnet line documented on anthropic.com and release timelines is Sonnet 4.5 → 4.6 (2026-02-17) → Sonnet 5 (2026-06-30) → Sonnet 5.5 (2026-09-28) — sources state Sonnet 5 "was the most capable Sonnet-tier model until Claude Sonnet 5.5 succeeded it on September 28, 2026", with no 5.4 in between.
- **Model-ID registry absence:** Anthropic's ID-format docs (`claude-{name}-{major}[-{minor}]`) and the anthropics/skills registry list Sonnet IDs 4.5, 4.6, 5, 5.5 only; the deprecations page recommends `claude-sonnet-5-5` as the migration target.
- **Pricing-table absence:** Portkey's Anthropic model/pricing coverage and other gateway tables list no `claude-sonnet-5-4` row.
- **Lineup statement:** coverage of Anthropic's current catalog reports the lineup as four models — Fable 5.1, Opus 5.5, Sonnet 5.5, Haiku 5.5 — with no 5.4-tier member.
- **Search trail:** exact-phrase `"Claude Sonnet 5.4" Anthropic`, ID-format `"claude-sonnet-5-4"`, and leaderboard queries return only GPT-5.4-vs-Claude-Sonnet-5 comparison pages (a name-collision false positive: GPT-5.4 is an OpenAI model, unrelated) and Sonnet 5 / 5.5 pages.

